{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2045","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"J. Xorderable Array"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1024 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an array $$$A$$$ of $$$N$$$ integers: $$$[A_1, A_2, \\dots, A_N]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The array $$$A$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$(p, q)$$$-xorderable"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if it is possible to rearrange $$$A$$$ such that for each pair $$$(i, j)$$$ that satisfies $$$1 \\leq i \\lt j \\leq N$$$, the following conditions must be satisfied after the rearrangement: $$$A_i \\oplus p \\leq A_j \\oplus q$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"and"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$A_i \\oplus q \\leq A_j \\oplus p$$$. The operator $$$\\oplus$$$ represents the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise xor"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given another array $$$X$$$ of length $$$M$$$: $$$[X_1, X_2, \\dots, X_M]$$$. Calculate the number of pairs $$$(u, v)$$$ where array $$$A$$$ is $$$(X_u, X_v)$$$-xorderable for $$$1 \\leq u \\lt v \\leq M$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line consists of two integers $$$N$$$ $$$M$$$ ($$$2 \\leq N, M \\leq 200\\,000)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line consists of $$$N$$$ integers $$$A_i$$$ ($$$0 \\leq A_i \\lt 2^{30})$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line consists of $$$M$$$ integers $$$X_u$$$ ($$$0 \\leq X_u \\lt 2^{30})$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer representing the number of pairs $$$(u, v)$$$ where array $$$A$$$ is $$$(X_u, X_v)$$$-xorderable for $$$1 \\leq u \\lt v \\leq M$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 4\n0 3 0\n1 2 1 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 2\n0 7 13 22 24\n12 10\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 3\n0 0 0\n1 2 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Explanation for the sample input/output #1"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The array $$$A$$$ is $$$(1, 1)$$$-xorderable by rearranging the array $$$A$$$ to $$$[0, 0, 3]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Explanation for the sample input/output #2"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The array $$$A$$$ is $$$(12, 10)$$$-xorderable by rearranging the array $$$A$$$ to $$$[13, 0, 7, 24, 22]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"J","problemCode":"2045J","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2045/problem/J"}